<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-NANTES STRIKER N'DORAM LIKELY TO MISS PSG CLASH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NANTES STRIKER N'DORAM LIKELY TO MISS PSG CLASH.</headline>
<dateline>NANTES, France 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nantes striker Japhet N'Doram is nursing an ankle injury and may miss the French league match against Paris St Germain on Saturday.</p>
<p>N'Doram, the first division's top marksman with 14 goals, has not trained since Monday.</p>
